AltoMintMarket::claimInterest()
├── when market is paused
│   └── it should revert
├── when feeRecipient is zero address
│   └── it should revert
└── when market is not paused
    ├── when claimable fees is zero
    │   ├── it should not transfer tokens
    |   └── it should return zero
    └── when claimable fees is greater than zero
        ├── it should mint tokens to fee recipient and set claimableFeesAssets to zero
        └── it should return zero